This package bundles data compiled from third-party sources. The data
files keep their source and retrieval date, and the generated code in
src/generated/ is derived from them.

data/iso4217-list-one.xml
  ISO 4217 List One (current currency and funds code list), published
  by SIX Financial Information AG as the ISO 4217 maintenance agency,
  https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/financial-information/data-standards.html
  Snapshot published 2026-09-17. ISO 4217 is a standard of the
  International Organization for Standardization.

data/stripe.json
  Currency and minor-unit rules from Stripe's documentation,
  https://docs.stripe.com/currencies, retrieved 2026-11-07, with short
  quotations of the special cases. Stripe is a trademark of Stripe, Inc.

data/adyen.json
  Currency codes and decimals from Adyen's documentation,
  https://docs.adyen.com/development-resources/currency-codes,
  retrieved 2026-11-07, with short quotations of the special cases.
  Adyen is a trademark of Adyen N.V.

data/stripe-fx.json
  Field definitions for exchange rates on balance transactions, quoted
  from Stripe's API reference,
  https://docs.stripe.com/api/balance_transactions/object, retrieved
  2026-11-07.

data/adyen-fx.json
  Column definitions for exchange rates in the settlement details
  report, quoted from Adyen's documentation,
  https://docs.adyen.com/reporting/settlement-reconciliation/transaction-level/settlement-details-report,
  retrieved 2026-11-07.

data/cash-rounding.json
  Cash rounding rules compiled from central-bank, statutory and
  government publications, retrieved 2026-11-07. Each entry records
  its source URL and whether it was verified against a primary source.

